WEBVTT

00:01:56.979 --> 00:02:00.273
You can see it in Pedro.

00:02:00.273 --> 00:02:03.849
[Danny Perasa to his wife Annie Perasa married 26 years]

00:02:03.849 --> 00:02:05.579
Danny Perasa: See, the thing of it is,

00:02:05.579 --> 00:02:08.282
I always feel guilty when I say "I love you" to you,

00:02:08.282 --> 00:02:11.174
and I say it so often. I say it to remind you

00:02:11.174 --> 00:02:14.228
that as dumpy as I am, it's coming from me,

00:02:14.228 --> 00:02:18.500
it's like hearing a beautiful song from a busted old radio,

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:20.625
and it's nice of you to keep the radio around the house.

00:02:20.625 --> 00:02:22.938
(Laughter)

00:02:22.938 --> 00:02:25.638
[Michael Wolmetz with his girlfriend Debora Brakarz]

00:02:25.638 --> 00:02:28.696
Michael Wolmetz: So this is the ring that my father gave to my mother,

00:02:28.696 --> 00:02:30.228
and we can leave it there.